### Rule behavior documented

- **Pass:** No `blink`/`flash`/`strobe`/`seizure`/`flicker` in animation or `@keyframes` names; infinite loops ≥ ~0.67s for on/off toggles; KS `.pulse` / `.pulse-amber` (3s) and hover `.breathe-*` (≥2.2s); no visible autoplay video.
- **Fail:** `@keyframes blink` + `animation: blink 0.2s infinite`; risky names; visible `<video autoplay>`.
- **Evidence:** `motionNoAutoPlayFlashReport.violations[]` kinds: `fast-infinite-animation`, `risky-animation-name`, `risky-keyframes-name`, `autoplay-video`.

